        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">近战武器攻击：命中采取你的法术攻击加值，触及5尺，单一目标。命中：1d6+3+法术环数的挥砍伤害。如果目标处于中毒状态，其必须进行一次体质豁免对抗你的法术豁免DC，否则麻痹直到目标下回合结束。</span></p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20 + @srd5e.userchar.spellAttackRanged]]{your spell attack modifier} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> [[/damage 1d6 + 3 + 3]]{1d6 + 3 + the spell's level} slashing damage. If the target is &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned], it must succeed on a Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC or be &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed] until the end of its next turn.</p></div>",
